ail_31 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bisecthosting-server-integration-menu-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">BisectHosting Server Integration Menu [FORGE]（由 BisectHosting 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/furnace-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">Furnace Overhaul（由 TheCazadorSniper 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ae-additions-extra-cells-2-fork\" rel=\"nofollow\">AE Additions - ExtraCells2 Fork（由 MasterYodAT9G 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diet-hoppers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Diet Hoppers（由 Forge_User_06804776 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/redstone-arsenal\" rel=\"nofollow\">Redstone Arsenal（由 TeamCoFH 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/contenttweaker\" rel=\"nofollow\">ContentTweaker（由 Jaredlll08 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/packmode\" rel=\"nofollow\">PackMode（由 Sky_Som 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cooking-for-blockheads\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cooking for Blockheads（由 BlayTheNinth 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blood-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blood Magic（由 WayofTime 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/abyssalcraft-integration\" rel=\"nofollow\">AbyssalCraft Integration（由 Shinoow 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-energistics-jee\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Energistics (JEE)（由 TheRealp455w0rd 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magneticraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Magneticraft（由 cout970 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-utilities-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Utilities (Forge)（由 FTB 制作）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\